WEBVTT

00:08:27.531 --> 00:08:30.233
dictated collaboration, they did so

00:08:30.233 --> 00:08:33.809
in spite of lethal ideological opposition to each other.

00:08:33.809 --> 00:08:36.725
When Iran's ideological impulses collided

00:08:36.725 --> 00:08:38.955
with its strategic interests,

00:08:38.955 --> 00:08:42.618
the strategic interests always prevailed.

00:08:42.618 --> 00:08:45.611
This is good news, because it means

00:08:45.611 --> 00:08:48.197
that neither war nor enmity

00:08:48.197 --> 00:08:51.867
is a foregone conclusion.

00:08:51.867 --> 00:08:54.422
But some want war.

00:08:54.422 --> 00:08:57.626
Some believe or say that it's 1938,

00:08:57.626 --> 00:08:59.538
Iran is Germany,

00:08:59.538 --> 00:09:02.704
and Ahmadinejad is Hitler.